y":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","number":16,"title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-07-30T14:56:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-02T16:27:23Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/121939","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121939","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121939.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/121939.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- Followup to #115474\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nWhile `RegEx` is now integrated into the core of the engine, it's still implemented as if it were a module. That is: a lot of arguments/returns setup for bindings `TypedArray`/`Variant`, and always requiring `Object` metadata/binds. This prevents the implementation from being as lightweight as it could be.\r\n\r\nThis is a problem other core types circumvent through the use of `CoreBind`, which I propose our current implementation of `RegEx` be moved to. In its place, we can integrate a core-specific implementation, which only needs a handful of includes & fully utilizes internal wrappers like `Vector` to make this tooling efficent and performant.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nAdds `is_valid()` check to the new `RegExMatch` directly, as an empty `_data` *should* only occur when no matches were found whatsoever (an empty match would contain 1 empty item, not be empty outright). Also changed all private variables to have an underscore prefix, as is our modern convention.","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121939/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":2},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121939/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}